**Shape:** 17 beats from four real headless `claude -p` runs. The film shows the anatomy of a `SKILL.md` by ablation — bare (no skill file → grade appears), minimal skill (14 lines, frontmatter+workflow → `Skill()` fires but grade still lands), full skill (27 lines with `## Never` + `## Definition of done` → refuses grade + runs checker → PASS), durability (same skill on a second student → same PASS). One BFLOW re-render needed after `CCPlanCard` was authored with the wrong prop shape (fixed in both `author_sheet.py` and the sheet directly; memory noted for future reels). Not published.
